WAITING FOR FRED

  Nothing.

WATCH OUT

  This project does not protect a workstation. No live login or seat
  changes without explicit approval and a recorded rollback point.
  Do not rely on vlock --all or VT_PROCESS (both failed open on SIGKILL).
  Graphical sessions must launch compositors via exec as session leader.
